  "policy": [
    "Project towns use authored world anchors validated against the NinjaOne territory mask and accepted land alpha.",
    "The three project towns occupy western, central, and eastern districts across the territory instead of collapsing into the capital core.",
    "Each project district owns one bounded territory-landform contact tile; roads between districts remain infrastructure work.",
    "Each project building is a local evidence node owned by NinjaOne and uses the shared world projection and light.",
    "Project footprints are smaller than the employer capital and are fixed world sizes rather than screen-space icons.",
    "Project structures own no terrain, roads, labels, actors, or interaction effects.",
